# BREAKING NEWS ON THE IDLE CHAT VOTE AND CHAT VOTE

I think I may of found a way to break past the ban barrier on the Idle Chat Vote and Chat Vote. Basically whenever you create and delete accounts over and over again. Utonish goes crazy and bans them. BUT heres the catch. So within a short amount of time before Utonish bans an account, you have what I like to call a "Grace Period" in which you have a certain amount of time to vote before ultimately Utonish bans an account. This grace period lasts around 5-10 seconds and during this time you can vote as much as you want before Utonish bans. Buts heres why I think this. So there have been theories which corollate to Utonish having an automated ban system since bans can pretty much happen at anytime of the day even when Utonish is supposedly asleep, bans can still happen at random. But due to my recent breakthrough of the Ban barrier, I think I might of figured it out, that indeed the banning is all automated since everytime I create an account, I end up losing it after the same amount of time each time I create an account which is 5-10 seconds aka the Grace Period. Also I noticed the system might of mistaken Caucasian's account during that time as botting too since it banned Caucasian's Sweden account from voting Sweden which is strange since it had nothing to do with my actions. So with that being said, I can now say that this indeed is all a simulation, that we are all trying to break out of. God only knows how far we will get but we will get to the bottom of this Utonish predicament.

