# My Official Statement about Sonar and Mango
I along with the rest of the community have tried to work with Sonar and Mango and it has gone nowhere. So I want to say one thing. **WE WILL NOT TOLERATE THIS TYPE OF BEHAVIOR IN GCAT ANYMORE, AND IF YOU WANT TO ACT LIKE THIS, LEAVE GCAT NOW AND DO IT ELSEWHERE.** I cannot stand this happening anymore and seeing our work go to waste everytime this happens. So with that being said Sonar and Mango will be banned from participating in GCAT for a week and if they continue, we may result to permanently ban them from GCAT altogether.

