# My Official Statement about the ComboVote

So as some of yall know, I tried to make something great with this new Utonish voting game known as the “ComboVote” which comes from the already existing ChatVoteCombo, and I just wanna say that I have failed. I’m gonna continue voting, not for gaining points and votes, but rather how big of a combo I can get. I give up voting Vietnam because they are a lost cause, but I will continue to vote whoever is number 1 for the rest of the ComboVote’s history and will see how big of a Combo I can make. But once again I give up prioritizing a formal number 1 country, and rather focus on growing a massive combo.

@Máxi @Lenon (Stadtbild) @Shut Up Maypi @Vicky
# My Statement about what happened on Thursday and Friday

So it comes to my attention that Máxi wants me to apologize to you guys for what I have been doing for these past couple months which I didn’t really care to notice until now. Basically it goes back to to April with my Philippines operation bringing them ahead of Taiwan. I became a really bad person again and I wanted to break TW all because of how she treated me. And in the process I passed Chispa’s Chile and I constantly called him out for his voting activities because I thought he was botting. I didn’t think much about it but that might have been the start of all of this drama. Then I passed Vicky and Máxi’s Argentina as India(which I botted) to which Argentina became more prominent and began to vote more. Then most importantly I began to help Danto with Vietnam recently which Argentina was going to pass swiftly, and I even though this one was the only legitimate operation on the combo in awhile, I genuinely feel bad for causing so many bad things to happen with you guys. I’m deeply sorry for making you guys endure so much suffering because of my actions. I tried to make a difference many times but ended up failing. I don’t know if you guys will forgive me for this because of all the bad things I have done in the past 2 years as PAP, Nigeria, and now Combo stuff—its hard to forgive someone when they have done things over and over again, but at least we can move on from this and not do anything stupid like before ever again. I will try to control my emotions better, and not make myself do anymore stupid operations against what you guys want. Hopefully in 2026 will be a new era of voting for us, and we can learn from our past mistakes to make good. Also sorry for how I tried you yesterday Máxi. So with that being said let’s move on from this even if it’s hard to and let’s make sure this doesn’t happen again!

